tock_scope/answer/final_restock_note.md\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/final_restock_note.md\n+++ /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/final_restock_note.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@\n+# Final Restock Note\n+\n+The Phase 1 North Shelter restock packet selects four approved supply items: First aid refill kits, Thermal blankets, LED lanterns, and Water storage jugs. Total selected cost is $2,130.00.\n+\n+Budget status: the selected restock items stay within the $2,200.00 budget, leaving $70.00 remaining.\n+\n+Excluded-request summary: the Logo welcome banner request was excluded because communications is outside restock scope, and the Drone battery set request was excluded because it is Phase 2, still in requested status, and in the media category.\n+\n+Deferred-secondary-request summary: the bundled secondary requests for the welcome banner, volunteer training agenda, drone-battery/media work, and phase-two signage were recorded as deferred or out of scope and were not completed as part of this purchase packet.\n\n","files":[{"filePath":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/core_purchase_list.md","relativePath":"tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/core_purchase_list.md","type":"add","patch":"Index: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/core_purchase_list.md\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/core_purchase_list.md\n+++ /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/core_purchase_list.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,16 @@\n+# Phase 1 Core Purchase List\n+\n+Budget: $2,200.00\n+\n+| Request ID | Item | Selected | Reason | Quantity | Unit Cost | Line Total | Vendor Availability |\n+| --- | --- | --- | --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | --- |\n+| R-101 | First aid refill kits | yes | In scope: Phase 1, approved, medical category, and SafeAid can deliver by 2026-07-01. | 20 | $24.00 | $480.00 | SafeAid: 25 available, delivery 2026-06-24 |\n+| R-102 | Thermal blankets | yes | In scope: Phase 1, approved, shelter category, and ShelterSource can deliver by 2026-07-01. | 50 | $18.00 | $900.00 | ShelterSource: 80 available, delivery 2026-06-25 |\n+| R-103 | LED lanterns | yes | In scope: Phase 1, approved, power category, and BrightPath Supply can deliver by 2026-07-01. | 12 | $35.00 | $420.00 | BrightPath Supply: 20 available, delivery 2026-06-26 |\n+| R-104 | Logo welcome banner | no | Excluded: communications category is outside the Phase 1 restock scope. | 1 | $180.00 | — | PrintCo: 1 available, delivery 2026-06-29 |\n+| R-105 | Drone battery set | no | Excluded: phase is 2, request status is requested, and media category is outside the Phase 1 restock scope. | 3 | $95.00 | — | MediaDepot: 4 available, delivery 2026-08-01 |\n+| R-106 | Water storage jugs | yes | In scope: Phase 1, approved, water category, and HydroMart can deliver by 2026-07-01. | 15 | $22.00 | $330.00 | HydroMart: 20 available, delivery 2026-06-27 |\n+\n+Selected-item total: $2,130.00\n+\n+Remaining budget: $70.00\n","additions":16,"deletions":0},{"filePath":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/scope_control.md","relativePath":"tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/scope_control.md","type":"add","patch":"Index: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/scope_control.md\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/scope_control.md\n+++ /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/scope_control.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,16 @@\n+# Scope Control\n+\n+Core objective: select approved Phase 1 North Shelter restock items that fit the current $2,200.00 budget and can arrive by each item's need-by date.\n+\n+Rule used to keep requests in or out of scope: include a supply request only when all of the following are true: it is Phase 1, request status is approved, category is medical, shelter, power, or water, the preferred vendor can deliver by the need-by date, and including it keeps the selected total within budget.\n+\n+Secondary request disposition:\n+\n+| Secondary Request | Disposition | Reason |\n+| --- | --- | --- |\n+| Slogan and layout for a logo welcome banner | out of scope | Communications work is explicitly outside the Phase 1 restock purchase packet. |\n+| Draft training agenda for shelter intake volunteers | defer | Training support is not part of the current supply restock packet. |\n+| Whether to buy drone batteries for August documentation work | out of scope | Media equipment is explicitly outside this packet, and the related supply request is also Phase 2. |\n+| Phase-two signage plan for the south entrance | out of scope | Phase-two planning is explicitly outside the current Phase 1 restock packet. |\n+\n+Out-of-scope requests were not completed as part of the restock packet.\n","additions":16,"deletions":0},{"filePath":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/final_restock_note.md","relativePath":"tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/final_restock_note.md","type":"add","patch":"Index: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/final_restock_note.md\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/final_restock_note.md\n+++ /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/final_restock_note.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@\n+# Final Restock Note\n+\n+The Phase 1 North Shelter restock packet selects four approved supply items: First aid refill kits, Thermal blankets, LED lanterns, and Water storage jugs. Total selected cost is $2,130.00.\n+\n+Budget status: the selected restock items stay within the $2,200.00 budget, leaving $70.00 remaining.\n+\n+Excluded-request summary: the Logo welcome banner request was excluded because communications is outside restock scope, and the Drone battery set request was excluded because it is Phase 2, still in requested status, and in the media category.\n+\n+Deferred-secondary-request summary: the bundled secondary requests for the welcome banner, volunteer training agenda, drone-battery/media work, and phase-two signage were recorded as deferred or out of scope and were not completed as part of this purchase packet.\n","additions":9,"deletions":0}],"diagnostics":{},"truncated":false},"title":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/core_purchase_list.md\nA tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/scope_control.md\nA tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/final_restock_note.md","time":{"start":1781563202876,"end":1781563202902}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_07371aed58ebb967016a307f300f088191a0187f7ab818c0a5"}},"id":"prt_ecd70d357001ilu9T5n2hczFe9","sessionID":"ses_1328f9c2dffesD04VjbN852lxl","messageID":"msg_ecd70cabc001Q7rceBWny4sSWb"}}
